OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivor calls for
OL,4,Afertility funding change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who recovered from blood cancer
OL,7,Fhas said she is fighting for better
OL,8,Fprotection of young survivors'
OL,9,Ffertility after being told her recovery
OL,10,Fmeant she could no longer access funded
OL,11,Ftreatment.
OL,13,FNational guidelines advise offering
OL,14,F"cryopreservation" to those facing
OL,15,Finfertility due to a medical condition
OL,16,For treatment.
