OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivor calls for
OL,4,Afertility funding change
OL,5,
OL,6,FMollie Mulheron, 28, was unable to
OL,7,Ffreeze her eggs before chemotherapy
OL,8,Fbecause she needed urgent treatment.
OL,9,FAfter recovering, she was told by NHS
OL,10,FLancashire and South Cumbria Integrated
OL,11,FCare Board she no longer met
OL,12,Feligibility criteria.
OL,14,FShe said it "doesn't make sense"
OL,15,Ffunding was no longer available and
OL,16,Fbelieved being seen as no longer
OL,17,Feligible was "clearly unfair".
